  "description": "Azure Table Storage implementation for Unified.Data.Tables: TableStorage<T> (IStorage<T>) with in-memory caching, ETag optimistic concurrency, builder-driven partial (Merge) updates, role-gated protected properties, and a reflection-based object-graph serializer (nested types, JSON/GZip fallback, an oversized-cell policy), and lossless large values: a [TableValueSplit] string, byte[] or JSON-stored property larger than one 64 KB cell is stored across cells and continuation rows with integrity checks, or offloaded to Azure Blob Storage, and TableBlobContent streams blob-backed content. Builds on Unified.Data.Tables.Abstractions.",
